 | PP-opt | 1,187.73 s | 0.8419 req/s | 294.14 tok/s |
 | Speedup | **1.218x** | **+21.82%** | **+21.82%** |
 
+| Latency metric | Baseline | PP-opt | Change |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |
+| Mean | 125.77 s | 101.70 s | **-19.14%** |
+| P50 | 131.07 s | 107.63 s | **-17.88%** |
+| P99 | 356.09 s | 278.52 s | **-21.78%** |
